  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28535001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "哇，这是什么！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28535003",
              "text": "你的新家。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28535002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "超大的房子，是求婚礼物吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "一般来说，买了新房就是结婚的关系，\n那么现在，我已经是|101|的合法「老婆」了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28535006",
              "text": "你从哪看来的奇怪知识？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28535006",
              "text": "嗯，结奈真是单纯的家伙。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28535005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "嗯？你那是什么意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28535008",
              "text": "我说结奈很可爱。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28535007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "这还差不多……不过，你不会对后宅每个女人都说过这种话吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "该不会，还偷偷给其他女人买了房子吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28535011",
              "text": "……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28535011",
              "text": "怎么会呢？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28535010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "你心虚了，是说谎的味道。\n这么说你已经做好了跟别人出轨的打算吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "放心，我不会怪你的。\n是|101|魅力太大，那堆女人碰了不该碰的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "|101|喜欢我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28535015",
              "text": "当然。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28535014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28535015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "那有我一个就够了，你后宅那堆我帮你埋了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
